  hasPassiveAbility: 0
  isCrystal: 0
  difficulty: 3
  description: 'A dramatic, wide-throated bloom with long curling tendrils that arch
    back on themselves, its petals angled like a basin built to catch a whole storm
    at once. It never quite looks fully open and more like it''s always mid-unfurling.


    Said
    to hold something of the tide''s own heart at its centre, kept beating by however
    much rain it''s swallowed over its lifetime.'
  descriptionSecondary: Harvesting it yields a Heart item, carried to the World Tree
    and consumed there to reveal one of its three hidden crystal layers.
